<title>FRANCE: GOLF-RAIN DELAYS START OF FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-RAIN DELAYS START OF FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS, France 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heavy rain delayed the start of the French Open at the National Course in Paris on Thursday.</p>
<p>Flooded bunkers were the main problem as the incessant downpour overnight extended into the morning, causing a projected three-hour delay.</p>
</text>
